ase randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nCEO Zhao invites his business partner, Manager Wang, to a high-end restaurant for dinner. At the dinner table, CEO Zhao notices that Manager Wang shows great interest in a dish, but in fact, this dish is a bit salty. Then, CEO Zhao immediately praises that the taste of this dish is just right.\n\n[Question]\nWhy does Mr. Zhao say this?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Mr. Zhao is a regular customer of this restaurant, out of respect for the restaurant, he always praises every dish.\nB. Mr. Zhao thinks this dish is really delicious, so he tells the truth.\nC. Mr. Zhao does this out of politeness and social customs, in order to avoid embarrassment and maintain a harmonious dining atmosphere, so he chooses to praise this dish.\nD. Mr. Zhao wants to please Manager Wang in order to gain an advantageous position in future business cooperation.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":9.11035802531931E-4,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af52bd7c2ddb05a7fe3157e","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794452439128,"createTime":"2026-11-12 11:00:39","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"d2651a60f45c4c8d88c5f4699964427a"}